<title>CHILE: Chile's Mantos Blancos 1st-half net climbs.</title>
<headline>Chile's Mantos Blancos 1st-half net climbs.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's Empresa Minera de Mantos Blancos SA on Monday reported the following results for the first half of the year:</p>
<p>			   1H 1997	    1H 1996</p>
<p>Net profit		     40.06    profit  10.08</p>
<p>Operating profit	     52.56    profit  16.30</p>
<p>Non-operating loss	    4.71	loss   4.13 Total</p>
<p>revenues			156.49		115.11</p>
<p>NOTES: Mantos Blancos, the only large copper producer trading on the Santiago bolsa, is 75 percent owned by Minorco SA. All figures are in millions of dollars.</p>
</text>
